name = "The Owl Eye"
description = "With a background in alchemy, Bellia is taking a very methodical approach in dealing with Shroon. To learn Shroon's secrets, Bellia asks you to get 20 Gold Fragments to make a tool that can monitor his activities. You can get Gold Fragments by fighting Captain Moldies."
